        {
          "alias": "title",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Ph\u1EA7n thi tr\u1EAFc nghi\u1EC7m"
        },
        {
          "alias": "description",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "{topicCount} chuy\u00EAn \u0111\u1EC1, t\u1ED5ng c\u1ED9ng {total} c\u00E2u. \u003Cb\u003EL\u00E0m Chuy\u00EAn \u0111\u1EC1 1 tr\u01B0\u1EDBc\u003C/b\u003E, v\u00EC c\u00E1ch quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh h\u1ECDc \u1EDF \u0111\u00F3 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c d\u00F9ng l\u1EA1i \u1EDF c\u00E1c chuy\u00EAn \u0111\u1EC1 sau. M\u1ED7i c\u00E2u hi\u1EC7n ph\u1EA7n gi\u1EA3i th\u00EDch sau khi b\u1EA1n ch\u1ECDn."
        },
        {
          "alias": "notice",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Website kh\u00F4ng tr\u1EF1c 24/7. Khi \u0111ang x\u1EA3y ra s\u1EF1 vi\u1EC7c, h\u00E3y g\u1ECDi ngay t\u1ED5ng \u0111\u00E0i ng\u00E2n h\u00E0ng c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n v\u00E0 c\u01A1 quan C\u00F4ng an n\u01A1i c\u01B0 tr\u00FA."
        }
      ]
    },
